  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Legal Assistance Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AANMG will offer farmers in the community of Se&apos;konon a series of informal training sessions on the benefits of crop diversification and the risks of dependence on a single crop and excessive application of pesticides. They should also acquire the skills necessary to organize more effectively and obtain clear title to their land. The results, including the development of a more reliable food supply, should benefit 300 families.</narrative>
  </description>
